ACME: Our Multi-cultural Multi-embodiment Social Navigation and Pedestrian Trajectory Prediction Dataset work is released on [arxiv](https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.21964). ACME is currently the largest (by duration) expert-driven multi-embodiment multi-modal dataset for social navigation! 
We are working on releasing the data on HuggingFace soon. Stay tuned!
